\noindent\textbf{Implementation Details}
The algorithm is implemented in our open-source repository.

\begin{enumerate}
  \item \textbf{Data ingestion} — Each AMASS frame is loaded at 30 Hz; noise is reduced with a 1-€ filter.
  \item \textbf{Vector computation} — Eq.~\eqref{eq:v_human} is evaluated per frame.
  \item \textbf{Scaling} — $\lambda$ is updated online; a fallback $\lambda_{0}$ is used when $L_{\mathrm h}<\tau_{\min}$.
  \item \textbf{Mapping} — $\mathbf p_{\text{cmd}}$ is obtained and clipped.
  \item \textbf{Robot actuation} — Non-blocking SDK calls \texttt{set\_position($x,y,z$, speed, wait=False)} achieve 20 Hz command throughput.
\end{enumerate}

