\   Moreover, \ignore{and since tuple $\tau_i^\prime$ will be exogenous only if $\tau_i$ is exogenous,} the set of exogenous tuples of $D^\prime$ is $D^{\prime^\nit{ex}}  = \{\tau^\prime_1,\tau^\prime_2\}$.


