\ Notice that the position of the new variable $v$ in relation $T^\prime$ does not change the outcome of the transformation. Whether we use $T^\prime(v,z)$ of $T^\prime(z,v)$, the new tuples assign the fresh constants to the intended position for $v$, and maintain the original constants in the position of $z$. In either case, the transformed query $\mc{Q}$ produces the same result as that of $\mc{Q}$ on any subset $S \subseteq D$ mapped to $D^\prime$.
