    Notice that, with Theorem \ref{theo:ces_resp_aligned} we have a full characterization of  the space of multi-component queries. \ That is, for any BCQ with two or more components, we can determine if {\sf CES} and {\sf Resp} are aligned for every possible instance or there exists one where they are not aligned. \
    The following result follows from Proposition \ref{prop:multicomp_pos} and the results from Section \ref{sec:single} (for the terms involved, see Definition \ref{def:component_coinvar}).

