        \vspace{1mm} \noindent (b) For each atom $U_z \in \nit{Atoms}(z)$ and for each tuple $\tau_S$ from the relation $S$ of $D^\star$, we create a tuple from $U_z$ by putting in the $x$ and $z$'s position the value of $x$ and $z$ in the tuple $\tau_S$, and replacing by a constant $c^\prime$ the rest of variables. Only the tuples created from $A_S$ are endogenous.

