\section{Conclusion}

We propose a distributed clustering algorithm (DCA) based on the coalition game theory for the clustering problem of intelligent vehicles based on the coalition formation game framework. We proved that the proposed algorithm converges to a Nash-stable solution while simultaneously satisfying some practical constraints, such as the cluster size, the cluster diameter, etc. In the case study and numerical experiments, we compared our algorithm with state-of-the-art coalition formation algorithms under different scales of VANET. The experiments showed that our algorithm was superior in terms of both the solution quality and the convergence efficiency.



