Given \(\Delta = 0.5956\) under our simulation setup, the thresholds computed from Theorem~\ref{theorem:combined} are \(\frac{\Delta - b}{a} = 0.8117\) for risk-prone skipping and \(-\frac{b}{a} = 0.0810\) for risk-averse skipping.  
